# Effective .dockerignore for `docker build -f mayhem/Dockerfile` (BuildKit prefers this over the
# root .dockerignore). Same as upstream's, plus: local build dirs, and the two submodules the fuzz
# build never reads (mqtt-c: MQTT PubSub is off by default; ua-nodeset: only the FULL namespace-zero
# build needs it, the fuzz/unit builds use the REDUCED one). The .git directory is kept (full history).
.github
.dockerignore
.travis*
appveyor.yml
docker
build
build-*
TinyDockerfile
deps/mqtt-c
deps/ua-nodeset
